# Guided PR review engineering

Planning, design, or implementation in this repo: read and follow
/10x-engineer at .cursor/skills/10x-engineer/SKILL.md. One skill per
turn. Do not invent a workflow. Do not restate that skill's phase table here.

This is the product git root (private GitHub HoeZey/guided-pr-review), not
Braid Connection Designer. Capture lives under docs/, not context/. Do not
open TCD Jira or create-jira-ticket unless the user explicitly asks. Jira is
write-locked unless they ask to create, edit, comment, or transition.

Use graft first for file/symbol discovery (ask, callers, skeleton, map)
before grep or reading a whole file. Then ado for Azure DevOps PR ingest.
GitHub MCP is for this repo's own PRs, never for TCD product PRs (those
are ADO).

Lookup: docs/README.md, then docs/prds/<feature>/README.md, then that
feature's issues/. Next work from issue status (todo / doing / done) and
.handoff/guided-pr-review.md.

No copy of skill text into rules.
